{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26871","headline":"题宣义池亭 · 姚合","name":"题宣义池亭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"春入池亭好，风光暖更鲜。\n寻芳行不困，逐胜坐还迁。\n细草乱如发，幽禽鸣似弦。\n苔文翻古篆，石色学秋天。\n花落能漂酒，萍开解避船。\n暂来还愈疾，久住合成仙。\n迸笋搘堦起，垂藤压树偏。\n此生应借看，自计买无钱。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"姚合","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26871.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26871","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}